WEBVTT

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.900
Long time no see, Team Q4!

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:16.800
And Toshiki Kai!

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:24.390
I'm glad to see you all looking so well, Q4!

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.290
What is he talking about?

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.940
And what are you doing here?!

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:33.630
I'm sure AL4 is participating 
in a different tournament...

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:37.380
This is revenge...

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:43.700
That's right! I've come back for revenge!

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:27.290
Something about him has changed...

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:28.990
Maybe something happened?

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:33.600
"Something"?

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:36.860
Yeah...

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:40.260
Something happened! In fact, plenty happened!

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:45.850
Kyou's Revenge

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:51.900
I lost everything when I lost to you.

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:01.410
I ride Nehalem!

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.810
I attack with Nehalem, boosted by Conroe!

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:14.530
Please! Once more!

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:17.920
Just one more time! Give me a chance!

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:21.770
Foo Fighter has no need for losers.

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:23.800
Give me back your ID card.

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:34.010
It serves you right.

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:35.350
What?!

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:39.080
Remember what you said?

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:44.890
I hear you and Ren are evenly matched...

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:48.800
So, if I defeat you, it 
means I'm stronger than Ren!

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:51.250
I'll be the leader of AL4!

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:53.900
Kyou, do you know what you're saying?

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:57.210
Sure! The guy with the most 
ability should stand at the top!

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.090
"Ability". A fine word...

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:05.930
Unfortunately, that doesn't seem 
to be a thing you're blessed with.

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:11.720
You have no right to be here. Get out!

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:21.770
Tch! Like Foo Fighters are 
the be-all and end-all!

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:24.490
You can't fire me, because I <i>quit</i>!

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:28.330
I can have a Cardfight anywhere!

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:28.980
Stupid...

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.210
But I was naive...

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:35.210
Excuse me?!

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:36.400
You refuse?!

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:39.380
The Great Kyou says he's willing to join you!

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:44.140
Oh, I get it.

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:46.480
You've never heard of me.

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:48.910
We know you. You're Kyou Yahagi, right?

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:51.020
You were fired from AL4.

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:53.840
I call Romario and Cutlass!

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:59.720
If we let you on our team, it'd 
draw Foo Fighter's attention.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.610
All right! I attack with Basskirk!

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:05.990
So don't take it the wrong way.

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:12.600
Get outta here!

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:15.500
No way!

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:25.850
Shoot!

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:55.890
Ren...

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.300
Revenge...

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:13.100
I'll get my revenge on 
you! I'll get my revenge!

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.540
Revenge!!

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:23.560
After vowing revenge, I remembered other 
former members of Foo Fighter who'd been kicked out

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:25.530
and dug them up.

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:28.740
The plan quickly took shape.

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:33.020
See, we all wanted revenge 
against Ren and Foo Fighter...

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:38.500
So we formed Team Avengers.

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:45.820
We have just one objective...

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:48.810
To beat AL4 and Ren at nationals,

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:51.660
and reign as the top Foo Fighters!

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:54.720
That will be our revenge!

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.900
And as a first step,

00:06:57.900 --> 00:06:59.140
Toshiki Kai...

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:05.270
The Great Kyou is going to claim you as his first 
victim, the guy who was lucky on the draw last time!

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:08.300
Fight me in the opening match!

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:10.770
If you're not too scared of me...

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:19.440
Final
Championship
Third Kanto Region Tournament

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:23.510
All right, this is the Vanguard Championship 
Third Kanto Region Tournament...

00:07:23.510 --> 00:07:25.620
...and we're at the final round at last!

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:29.600
This fresh team advanced to the finals 
by defeating the powerful Team Handsome

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:32.660
with an astounding show of strength...

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:34.340
Avengers!

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:39.220
And opposing them is Team Q4, our 
champions from the previous tournament!

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:42.640
Regrettably, at the national tournament, 
they suffered defeat in the elimination round,

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:45.380
but their ability cannot be underestimated!

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:47.640
This is <i>oh</i> so exciting!

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:50.820
Kyou Yahagi, huh?

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:53.790
He's creepy...

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:59.200
But the fact that he beat Gouki 
proves he's a first-rate Fighter.

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:03.520
Kai, are you gonna do what 
he said and fight first?

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.790
I'll go first.

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:10.790
Are you sure about this, Brother?!

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:13.000
Aren't you still tired from before?

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.150
Brother!

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:18.320
Are you okay?!

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:23.230
I guess I was nervous...

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:26.490
I'm fine now.

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:30.850
Besides, I know I can win.

00:08:35.050 --> 00:08:37.280
Fine with me. Do it.

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:39.160
Thank you, Kai!

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:45.900
Kai gave me his approval.

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:54.800
I swear I'll win this fight!

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:02.650
So Toshiki Kai ran away?

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:07.340
And he sent the weakest guy in his place?!

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:09.860
Although in a sense, it was a good call...

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:15.200
Look! This is the true character of Toshiki 
Kai, the guy who is said to be on par with Ren!

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:16.650
Pathetic!

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:18.530
And that's the best they got?!

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:23.330
You're going to lose.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.410
What was that?!

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:35.630
I'm going to use this card to beat you.

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.230
What?!

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:41.170
Wha...?! What are you saying, Brother?!

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:47.590
A declaration of victory 
before the match, eh?

00:09:47.590 --> 00:09:50.840
You've learned how to look cool, huh, Aichi?

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:52.890
That's my disciple!

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:55.490
But has Aichi always been 
that kind of person?

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:56.980
AB, yo?

00:09:56.980 --> 00:09:57.910
Um...

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:59.060
Now that you mention it...

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:01.250
He does seem a little strange.

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:03.200
Aichi...

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:16.090
As a sideshow, it's interesting.

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:19.770
But I'd double-check the card if I were you.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:23.600
Young Pegasus Knight...

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:27.920
How do you intend to beat 
me with a grade 1 card?

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:29.790
He has a point.

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:32.550
That's a good card even 
if it's not grade 1...

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:34.600
No, that's not what he was saying...

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:37.100
How many years have you been my disciple?

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:39.080
Wake up, Aichi!

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:41.370
What does he intend to do with a grade 1 card?

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:44.330
Good question. Lose-umi's comments aside...

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:47.010
I mean, it's <i>Katsumi</i>!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:52.200
The grade doesn't matter.

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:55.000
I'm going to beat you with this card.

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:58.780
It's a foregone conclusion.

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:07.780
R-Ren!

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:17.650
Calm down! He's just a guy who follows 
Toshiki Kai around like a shadow...

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:21.030
He's a third-rate fighter at best!

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:23.420
What he said just now was only a bluff!

00:11:25.470 --> 00:11:26.740
Are you both ready?

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:27.790
Yes!

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.250
Ready whenever!

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:33.630
I'm gonna make you regret 
opening your big mouth!

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:37.250
Aichi Sendou, right?

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:39.860
Strange, isn't it?

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:40.760
What is?

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:45.070
Him. I don't remember him 
being the type to bluff.

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:46.400
Come to think of it...

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:47.750
What's wrong with it?

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:50.060
This way's more fun!

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:53.420
All right, the final round at last!

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:55.970
Let the first fight begin!

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.920
Stand up, Vanguard!

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:17.910
I draw.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:21.650
I ride Marron.

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:23.200
Barcgal moves to the Rear.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:24.550
I activate Barcgal's skill.

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:26.760
I Superior Call Flogal!

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:32.540
That's the end of my turn.

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:34.560
That's all?

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:37.810
What about Young Pegasus Knight?

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:39.640
That's gonna decide the match, isn't it?

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:43.210
If you have time for idle chatter, please 
use it instead to proceed with the fight.

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:43.930
What?!

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:47.390
Aichi's sure showin' him who's boss!

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:49.660
What's wrong with Aichi today?

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:52.790
Maybe he's in a bad mood or something?

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:14.470
Talk big to me, will he?!

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:17.320
The question is, how long can he keep it up?!

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:22.140
I came back from the abyss 
of Hell! Witness my power!

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:24.760
The Great Kyou rides Wonder Boy!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:30.480
There it is!

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:32.070
"The Great Kyou rides"!

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:37.800
Cut it out! I'm the one who came up 
with the "the Great Kamui rides"!

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:39.490
Don't rip me off!

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:41.050
You ain't "great" anything!

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:42.910
That's right! Tell 'im!

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:45.270
TR! TR, yo!

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:46.670
I don't understand...

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.670
I move Mecha Trainer.

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:53.130
And then I call Spike Brothers Assault Squad!

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:56.020
Here I go!

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.270
I attack Marron!

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:00.270
No guard!

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:02.330
Drive trigger check!

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:08.550
Damage trigger check!

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:12.950
Assault Squad boosts!

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:14.940
I attack with Mecha Trainer!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.790
No guard.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.130
That's the end of the Great Kyou's turn.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:30.890
2 damage in my first turn. 
I'm off to a smooth start.

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:32.830
I stand and draw.

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:43.610
I call...

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:44.840
Young Pegasus Knight!

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:50.400
That's...

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.570
...the card he gave advance notice about!

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:54.570
I activate Barcgal's skill.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:58.260
Then I Superior Call Future Knight, Llew!

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:01.130
Llew's Counterblast!

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.880
I Superior Ride Blaster Blade!

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:19.150
I activate Young Pegasus Knight's skill!

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:26.070
During the main phase, for each card that 
was put in the Soul, this unit gets +3000 power!

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:29.950
The number of cards that 
went into his Soul...

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:31.600
Huh? How many was it again?

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:35.590
Marron, Llew, Barcgal and 
Flogal, so four, remember?!

00:15:36.970 --> 00:15:41.490
Pegasus Knight's total power is 18000!

00:15:42.970 --> 00:15:46.720
He even went as far as a Superior 
Ride to get more power!

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:48.050
I call Gallatin!

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:51.700
Gallatin!

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:56.320
I guard with Assault Squad!

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:08.480
Your attack didn't get through!

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:10.230
Gallatin, come back!

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:15.980
No guard!

00:16:15.980 --> 00:16:17.950
Drive trigger check!

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:22.000
Damage trigger check!

00:16:22.350 --> 00:16:24.080
Critical trigger!

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:26.560
I give all the effects to Wonder Boy!

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:33.820
However, powering up that much isn't 
enough to protect against this attack.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:36.140
Go, Pegasus Knight!

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:48.880
He did it! He dealt damage 
with the card he warned about!

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:52.280
But that was just 2 damage.

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:55.170
Wasn't he overstating it when 
he said he'd <i>win</i> with that card?

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:56.940
Besides that...

00:16:58.510 --> 00:17:00.450
Tryin' to throw a scare into me...

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:04.890
Saving up in the Soul and turning it into 
added power is just a one-time trick.

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:08.510
When this turn is over, Pegasus 
Knight's power will be 6000 again.

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:10.660
It'll be no more than a grade 1 card.

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:14.320
Just like I thought, you're all talk!

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:17.390
We'll see about that.

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:22.770
What's wrong, Kyou?

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:24.890
Are you scared of a guy like that?!

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:26.950
S-Shut up!

00:17:28.570 --> 00:17:29.530
Why?

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:31.160
Why...

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:34.340
Why do I think of <i>him</i>?

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:37.850
That's the end of my turn.

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:39.850
Darn it!

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:42.280
What am I afraid of him for?!

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:45.070
I won't get my revenge at this rate!

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:49.130
I'm... Crusher Kyou!

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:56.130
Don't get frazzled! A grade 1 like that doesn't 
have the ability to affect the game!

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:03.100
The Great Kyou rides 
Treasured, Black Panther!

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:07.320
I call Dudley Dan!

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:12.330
I'm gonna retire that 
annoying Pegasus Knight!

00:18:12.330 --> 00:18:15.880
I attack with Mecha Trainer, 
boosted by Assault Squad!

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:27.270
This way, your prediction's 
gonna be way off base!

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:33.330
How embarrassing!

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:35.200
W-What's with you all of a sudden?!

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:36.580
After all...

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:39.320
I'm gonna use this card to beat you!

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:41.360
...is what he said!

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:44.800
And to have that card sent 
off the field so easily...

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:46.470
It's embarrassing!

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:48.980
This guy's tickin' me off. Can I hit him?

00:18:49.430 --> 00:18:53.230
Sorry! This is his way of being worried...

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:56.570
Too bad!

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:59.400
It would've been cool if it had worked 
out the way he said, you know?

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:02.530
Just goes to show he's not 
really much of a Fighter...

00:19:03.230 --> 00:19:04.530
I'm not sure.

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:06.130
You disagree?

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:10.620
The fight isn't over yet. 
It's written all over his face.

00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:15.280
Here I go!

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:16.890
Dudley Dan boosts!

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:20.130
Treasured, Black Panther 
attacks Blaster Blade!

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:23.060
And with Dudley Dan's boost, 
I activate his Counterblast!

00:19:24.570 --> 00:19:27.990
On top of that, by putting the Dudley 
Dan that was in my hand into the Soul,

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:30.470
I can Superior Call Sky Diver!

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:34.420
What?!

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:39.440
Even though his Vanguard is grade 
2, he called a grade 3 unit!

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:42.040
What?! He can do that?!

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:43.920
What a beautiful skill!

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:44.720
Morikawa...

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:46.740
Cheer our side on a little!

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:48.700
Well, what are you gonna do?!

00:19:49.360 --> 00:19:50.700
No guard.

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:53.510
Fine with me! Drive trigger check!

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:55.630
There it is!

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:57.070
Draw trigger!

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:59.530
I add +5000 to the power of Sky Diver!

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:03.110
And then I draw!

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:05.010
Go, Black Panther!

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:12.930
Next, I attack with Sky Diver, 
whose power is now 16000!

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:22.470
You drew that trigger for nothing, huh?

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:23.780
That's what you get!

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:26.960
He's at 4 damage now...

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:28.450
His opponent still has only 2...

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:30.490
This is kind of a tight situation.

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:33.830
It's still early. He might 
be able to catch up.

00:20:34.860 --> 00:20:36.050
Aichi...

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:38.830
I stand and draw.

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:44.990
I have a bad feeling about this...

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:46.510
Don't tell me...

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:49.990
Enter the fray, King of all Knights!

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:53.090
I ride King of Knights, Alfred!

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:55.570
Yes!

00:20:55.630 --> 00:20:56.960
It's Alfred!

00:20:56.960 --> 00:20:59.070
Grade 3s are the most powerful!

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:00.190
That's why you're excited...

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:05.180
On top of that, I call Little Sage, 
Marron and Swordsman of the Explosive Flames, Palamedes!

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:11.800
And then...

00:21:12.780 --> 00:21:16.810
N-No way... That card...?

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:19.600
Yes way, indeed.

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:24.590
A second Pegasus Knight?!

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:29.300
So he had another one?!

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:31.350
Then his advance notice...

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:37.650
I call Young Pegasus Knight.

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:39.990
Like I said...

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:43.030
I'm going to beat you with this card.

00:21:45.790 --> 00:21:49.160
Aichi... I was right...

00:22:00.440 --> 00:22:04.460
Why?! Why can I see him?!

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:09.350
Now, picture this...

00:22:09.710 --> 00:22:14.100
You, defeated before an overwhelming power...

00:23:51.390 --> 00:23:53.010
Here we are, the final round.

00:23:53.230 --> 00:23:56.470
Let's not think of this as a return match 
or anything, but just have fun with it.

00:23:56.470 --> 00:23:59.750
Don't worry. I'm going to win... definitely.

00:23:59.750 --> 00:24:03.080
Mmm, Aichi, you're letting your 
feelings get the better of you.

00:24:03.080 --> 00:24:04.710
Come on, relax, relax.

00:24:04.710 --> 00:24:06.250
I'm plenty relaxed.

00:24:06.250 --> 00:24:09.480
Kamui and Misaki, don't you 
two get in my way either.

00:24:09.930 --> 00:24:10.730
Excuse me?

00:24:10.730 --> 00:24:12.720
Next time: Psyqualia!

00:24:12.720 --> 00:24:15.600
I can picture the road to victory.

00:24:16.040 --> 00:24:17.730
The real picture...

00:24:17.730 --> 00:24:19.100
Aichi...
